# documentation(median_ext)
_median_ext {s7_types.R}_

## Median of a measurement

------

*Registers methods for `stats::median`.*

### Description

Registers a method for the stats generic.

### Usage

```r
stats::median(x, ...)
```

### Methods

- `stats::median(<Measure>)`: The median value

